darwin-arm64, darwin-x64, linux-arm64, linux-x64, windows-x64. It is not
published to the npm registry. Those compiled executables EMBED the Bun runtime
and its bundled components, as well as the CLI's own (permissively licensed)
npm dependencies. Each embedded component is distributed under its own license;
this NOTICE does not alter those licenses.

You can print this NOTICE from the CLI itself by running `xata licenses`.

